    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42903" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a sending forth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				469.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵεμαι</span>) <i>an aiming at,</i> coined by
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				411d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				420a
			</span></i>: but the compd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφεσις</span> is
			found. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕζω</span>) <i>a sitting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hellad.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
				<u>Bibl.</u>
				p.535
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
